(
    landing_force_margin_share: (0.469133, Resolution("MEASURED settled coupled landing force means on declared grounds and fixture inclines; DERIVED weight-normalized signed gap span plus observer residual, rounded strictly upward at one part per million. This force deadband prevents gear hunting from landing-price/delivery spread and scales with the vehicle's nominal weight. Method, limits and distributions: track-model architecture section 5a.")),
)
